      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man engulfed in flames with the text 'get ready for your future white folks.. nuclear fire & eternal slavery!' This is a racially charged and hateful meme that uses violent and apocalyptic imagery to threaten and dehumanize white people, implying they will face punishment or destruction. The use of 'white folks' as a targeted group, combined with the graphic depiction of fire and slavery, constitutes a direct hateful attack based on race. The meme is designed to incite fear and hatred toward a specific racial group, making it clearly hateful content.",
