      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The man engulfed in flames is mapped as the embodiment of the threatening message directed at 'white folks'.",
      "description": "The visual entity 'man engulfed in flames' is mapped onto the textual entity 'white folks' as the target of the threat. The flames and the man's calm demeanor visually represent the 'nuclear fire & eternal slavery' that is being promised to 'white folks'. The mapping is established through the juxtaposition of the violent imagery with the text that explicitly names the target group and the punishment. The man's presence in the flames serves as a visual metaphor for the impending doom described in the text.",
