      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the targeted group via deictic language",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the group 'white folks' as the direct target of the threat. The deictic phrase 'your future' in the top text ('get ready for your future white folks..') explicitly addresses the user, implying that the user belongs to the targeted group and is therefore the recipient of the impending punishment described. The user is thus projected onto the textual entity 'white folks' as the intended victim of the apocalyptic threat.",
